  "video_link": "",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco presents the Moisture Wicking Security Polo Shirt. These professional security polo shirts are designed to keep you cool while on-the-job. These double-sided polo shirts have &ldquo;SECURITY&rdquo; printed across the back and front left chest. Moreover, these work polos are great for public safety, security guards, bike patrol, event staff, campus safety, stadium security, bouncers, and much more. These high-performance polo shirts work as hard as you do.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "4094",
  "description": "<p>Rothco presents the Moisture Wicking Security Polo Shirt. These professional security polo shirts are designed to keep you cool while on-the-job. These double-sided polo shirts have &ldquo;SECURITY&rdquo; printed across the back and front left chest. Moreover, these work polos are great for public safety, security guards, bike patrol, event staff, campus safety, stadium security, bouncers, and much more. These high-performance polo shirts work as hard as you do.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Staying Cool and Dry:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These security shirts wick sweat and wetness away for optimum comfort. Featuring our rapid moisture control fabric, sweat is swiftly transferred to the top layer, allowing for a quick dry. This prevents sweat from soaking through these moisture-wicking shirts so that they won&rsquo;t stick to your skin, giving you a full range of motion.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Dependable, Long-Lasting Material Composition:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These full-size cut polo shirts are 100% polyester. This durable material is lightweight and breathable, ensuring a comfortable fit for when you&rsquo;re on-duty.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>On the Move:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Along with a professionally styled 3-button front, these security work polos feature a ribbed knit collar for a clean crisp look. The collar, sleeves, and bottom hem are doubled-stitched for enhanced durability and strength.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Tag-Less Comfort:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These security job polo shirts also feature a tag-less neck label, freeing you from any itches or scratches.</li>\n</ul>",
